		(uuid "63401d75-edd3-400d-b17d-6d60eb04b235")
	)
	(text "U20 EFM8BB21F16G-C-QFN20 (C80713) — Layout O port map:\nP0.0 pin2=ESC_Bm; P0.1 pin1=ESC_Cm; P0.2 pin20=ESC_Am; P0.3 pin19=ESC_Vn\nP0.5 pin17=DShot (GPIO14 via 220R); VDD pin4=VBAT; GND pins3/12/EP=GND\nP1.0 pin14=ESC_Ap (N/PWM high); P1.1 pin13=ESC_Ac (P/COM low)\nP1.2 pin11=ESC_Bp; P1.3 pin10=ESC_Bc; P1.4 pin9=ESC_Cp; P1.5 pin8=ESC_Cc"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7e1ffe8e-3af2-4b61-89d6-cdb07e72148c")
	)
	(text "FLAG/GUI: place bee-core:EFM8BB21F16G-C-QFN20 + 3x AO3401A + 3x AO3400A + gate R +\\nsense R network + VBAT pad/polyfuse + bulk C. Prefer correct nets over fake completeness.\\nUNCERTAIN: P-FET full enhancement at Vgs=-(4.2-3.3)= -0.9V on 1S is NOT enough —\\nwhoop designs often gate P-FETs from VBAT-referenced drivers or use different FETs.\\nRe-check OpenAIO-Whoop / BLHeli hardware before PCB. Consider logic-level P or N-N+boost."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bdd9e869-ba0b-4e89-acec-7b298ee63124")
	)
	(text "BEMF 10k mux divider network: add per ESC-TOPOLOGY-DECISION.md / tinyPEPPER in next pass. 1k PHASE_A/B/C to ESC_Vn star populated here."
