	)
	(text "SECTION: ESC — EFM8BB21 + Layout A FET bridge (Bluejay)\\nCited: Bluejay Layouts/A.inc — PWM_ACTIVE_HIGH, COM_ACTIVE_HIGH, PWM side HIGH.\\nMCU: EFM8BB21F16G-C-QFN20 LCSC C80713. Silk: BLUEJAY LAYOUT A / VBAT MAX 1S.\\nDShot: GPIO14 -- Rseries 100-330R --> EFM8 P0.5 (pin 17).\\n1S direct-drive P+N whoop topology (no FD6288). Verify Vgs: 3.3V MCU vs AO3401 P-FET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
